BEHAVIOR duration

DESCRIPTION
  Calculates difference between two timestamps in milliseconds.
  Pure computation, no syscalls.

CONTRACT
  INPUT start int 8
  INPUT end int 8
  OUTPUT diff int 8
  GUARANTEES pure no_alloc writes_output

HASH 229d3d34

IMPLEMENTATION
  start_ms = LOAD start 8
  end_ms = LOAD end 8
  difference = ISUB end_ms start_ms 8
  STORE diff difference 8
END
